			"Message": "feat(Wind): Implement Live service layers for Commands, Editor, Extensions, Files, and Language\n\nAdd concrete Live implementations for the VS Code service interfaces introduced in the previous commit. Each service now has a functional implementation backed by Tauri IPC to communicate with Mountain (Rust backend):\n\n- **CommandsService**: Local handler registry for UI-side commands with IPC delegation to Mountain's CommandRegistry for extension commands\n- **EditorService**: Editor state via Ref subscriptions with Monaco command delegation for selections/decorations\n- **ExtensionsService**: Extension discovery and activation via Mountain's ExtensionManagementService IPC\n- **FilesService**: Full filesystem operations (read, write, stat, mkdir, delete, rename, copy, exists, watch) with URI → path normalization\n- **LanguageService**: In-memory provider registration tracking with local disposal support\n\nAll implementations use Effect-TS patterns with proper error modeling via discriminated union Problem types. The services are now integrated into TauriBaseLayer and TauriLiveLayer composition.",
			"SHA": "be5579b56a30e11bde1a45b8481b38ac9a366d4e"
		},
