				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1604,
				42
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add VS Code service interfaces for Commands, Editor, Extensions, Files, Language, and TextFile\n\nIntroduce six new service abstractions to Wind's Effect-TS based service layer, each modeled after corresponding VS Code services:\n\n- **CommandsService**: ICommandService for command registration/execution\n- **EditorService**: ICodeEditorService for editor lifecycle and selection management\n- **ExtensionsService**: IExtensionService for extension discovery and activation\n- **FilesService**: IFileService for file system operations\n- **LanguageService**: ILanguageService for language feature providers\n- **TextFileService**: ITextFileService for text file read/write/save operations\n\nEach service includes:\n- Interface definition with Effect-returning methods\n- Problem type for error modeling via discriminated unions\n- Context tag for Effect-TS dependency injection\n- Stub implementation for compile-time compatibility\n- Live and Mock Layer configurations\n\nThese interfaces establish the foundational service boundaries for Wind's re-implementation of VS Code's workbench services.",
			"SHA": "25265a307b53113e827858cacf603cc2c680b709"
		}
	],
